617 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Now that you\220ve looked around, it\220s time to interact with your home. This step is about safely testing the things you rely on every day\204windows, doors, vents, siding panels, and gutter edges. You\220re not diagnosing problems; you\220re just feeling for anything that seems off.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

618 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Sometimes, the early warning signs aren\220t visual\204they\220re physical. A window that sticks, a loose trim corner, or a spongy section of siding can tell you more than a crack ever could. These are the little signals your home gives when something's wearing out or shifting beneath the surface.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

