635 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(This pillar is about momentum. Once you\220ve spotted something minor\204and you\220re sure it\220s safe to handle\204go ahead and take care of it right then. Clearing leaves from a clogged downspout, making sure the lower end of the downspout has a clear path for proper drainage, tightening a loose hinge, or sealing a small gap doesn\220t require a contractor. It just takes a few minutes and a little awareness.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

