637 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(You\220re not trying to overhaul your home\204you\220re stacking small wins. These quick actions stop moisture from spreading, bugs from entering, and wear from escalating. They\220re the kind of fixes that, when ignored, lead to headaches down the road.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

